 ('x31-small-axial-force.png', 'Cantilever of 6 m with 17 loads of 1000 kN at the tip and 0.1 kN along the beam (section 7.46) — tab axial force: the axial force of 0.1 kN is drawn beside a fixing moment of 102 000 kNm. The 17 loads at one point carry one value with their number', 'simple-p', "m.nodes[0].sup = 'fixed'; m.nodes[1].sup = 'free'; m.loads = [{id: 1, m: 0, a: 6, P: 0.1, ang: 0}]; for (let i = 0; i < 17; i++) m.loads.push({id: 10 + i, m: 0, a: 6, P: 1000, ang: -90})", 'N', '', 1500, 900, 'light'),
